# Testing

See also: `docs/026_MASTER_TASKS.md` (definition of done)

## Layout

```
tests/
├── unit/
├── integration/   # Phase 2
└── e2e/           # Phase 2
```

## Commands

- `npm run test` — foundation unit tests (`tsx --test`)

## Expectations

| Layer | Cover |
|---|---|
| Unit | Pure utils, contracts, role constants, services without I/O |
| Integration | Repository + API against Supabase local (Phase 2) |
| E2E | RFQ → quote → order happy path (Phase 2) |

## Rules

- Add/adjust tests with behavior changes on critical paths
- Prefer deterministic fixtures over live network calls
- Do not snapshot entire pages unless layout-critical
- Definition of done includes tests for critical path features
